<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA VS INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA VS INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the one-day triangular series final between India and South Africa at Kingsmead on Thursday.</p>
<p>South Africa</p>
<p>    A.Hudson c Karim b Srinath			   19</p>
<p>    G.Kirsten c Dravid b Singh			   51</p>
